{"question": "Every major crisis in the world right now, in one minute", "country": "", "voice_speed": 0.95, "gap": 0.4, "cover": ["8 CRISES.", "RIGHT NOW.", "60 SECONDS."], "region": "THE WORLD, RIGHT NOW", "places": {"KYIV": {"id": "KYIV", "name": "Kyiv", "lat": 50.45, "lon": 30.52}, "HORMUZ": {"id": "HORMUZ", "name": "Strait of Hormuz", "lat": 26.56, "lon": 56.25}, "GAZA": {"id": "GAZA", "name": "Gaza", "lat": 31.5, "lon": 34.47}, "SANAA": {"id": "SANAA", "name": "Sanaa", "lat": 15.35, "lon": 44.21}, "KHARTOUM": {"id": "KHARTOUM", "name": "Khartoum", "lat": 15.5, "lon": 32.56}, "MEKELLE": {"id": "MEKELLE", "name": "Mekelle", "lat": 13.49, "lon": 39.47}, "GOMA": {"id": "GOMA", "name": "Goma", "lat": -1.68, "lon": 29.22}, "NAYPYIDAW": {"id": "NAYPYIDAW", "name": "Naypyidaw", "lat": 19.76, "lon": 96.08}}, "lines": [{"text": "Eight crises are burning right now. Here is every one, in one minute.", "src": [], "context": true, "note": "", "scene": {"type": "wide"}}, {"text": "Ukraine. Russian strikes killed at least 200 civilians in the first 24 days of September.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "UN News, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "KYIV", "head": "1/8  Ukraine", "notes": ["200+ civilians killed", "1-24 Sep 2026"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "The Iran war. Seven months in, ship traffic through Hormuz is down more than 90 percent.", "src": [1, 2], "context": false, "note": "DTN / The National", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "HORMUZ", "head": "2/8  Iran war", "notes": ["Hormuz traffic: -90%", "month 7"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Gaza. Over 90 percent of working-age adults have no job. 92 percent of businesses are damaged or destroyed.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "UN News, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "GAZA", "head": "3/8  Gaza", "notes": ["90%+ unemployed", "92% of businesses hit"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Yemen. About 125,000 people uprooted, and 73 UN staff held by the Houthis.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "UN News, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "SANAA", "head": "4/8  Yemen", "notes": ["125,000 uprooted", "73 UN staff detained"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Sudan. The world's largest displacement crisis. More than 14 million people forced from their homes.", "src": [3], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, Jul 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "KHARTOUM", "head": "5/8  Sudan", "notes": ["14M+ displaced", "world's largest"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Ethiopia. This week, Tigrayan forces seized Mekelle airport, breaking a truce from 2022.", "src": [4], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 23 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "MEKELLE", "head": "6/8  Ethiopia", "notes": ["Mekelle airport seized", "23 Sep 2026"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Congo. Clashes in the east, and an Ebola outbreak that has killed 2,325 people.", "src": [5], "context": false, "note": "Security Council Report, Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "GOMA", "head": "7/8  DR Congo", "notes": ["clashes in the Kivus", "Ebola: 2,325 deaths"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Myanmar. Five years after the coup, military airstrikes are still hitting schools and monasteries.", "src": [6], "context": false, "note": "Crisis Group, Aug 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "NAYPYIDAW", "head": "8/8  Myanmar", "notes": ["airstrikes on civilians", "5 years since the coup"], "span": 13}}, {"text": "Eight crises. One planet. Which one did we miss? Tell us below.", "src": [], "context": true, "note": "", "scene": {"type": "wide"}}], "sources": [{"n": 0, "outlet": "UN News", "title": "World News in Brief: 'New intensity' to Russian attacks on Ukraine, Yemen, Gaza and Colombia updates", "url": "https://news.un.org/en/story/2026/09/1168427"}, {"n": 1, "outlet": "DTN", "title": "Oil Below $100 Bbl as U.S.-Iran Diplomacy Awaited at U.N.", "url": "https://www.dtnpf.com/agriculture/web/ag/news/world-policy/article/2026/09/22/oil-100-bbl-u-s-iran-diplomacy-u-n-2"}, {"n": 2, "outlet": "The National", "title": "Oil prices top $105 as hopes fade for US-Iran breakthrough", "url": "https://www.thenationalnews.com/business/energy/2026/09/24/oil-prices-top-105-as-hopes-fade-for-us-iran-breakthrough/"}, {"n": 3, "outlet": "Al Jazeera", "title": "El-Obeid under siege by RSF: Could this be Sudan's next el-Fasher?", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/7/6/el-obeid-under-siege-by-rsf-could-this-be-sudans-next-el-fasher"}, {"n": 4, "outlet": "Euronews", "title": "Tigray rebels seize airport and clash with federal forces", "url": "https://www.euronews.com/2026/09/23/tigray-rebels-seize-airport-and-clash-with-federal-forces-as-fighting-in-ethiopia-reignite"}, {"n": 5, "outlet": "Security Council Report", "title": "Democratic Republic of the Congo, September 2026 Monthly Forecast", "url": "https://www.securitycouncilreport.org/monthly-forecast/2026-09/democratic-republic-of-the-congo-35.php"}, {"n": 6, "outlet": "International Crisis Group", "title": "Myanmar", "url": "https://www.crisisgroup.org/asia-pacific/south-east-asia/myanmar"}], "caption": "8 crises happening right now, in 60 seconds. Ukraine, the Iran war, Gaza, Yemen, Sudan, Ethiopia, Congo, Myanmar. Which one did we miss? Sources in the comments.", "hashtags": ["worldnews", "geopolitics", "war", "news", "outpost"]}
